{
  "_doc": "#1445 THE SOURCE OF TRUTH of the profile (Cloud Me ▸ Profile, and Cloud Account's Personal Info and Configs): the page tree, the renderer of each leaf page (`render`: entries:<kind> | autofill:<x> | configs:<x> | host:me), the field schema of each Personal Info kind (`kinds`, labels and masks only) and where Configs reads and writes (`configs_sources`, incl. `connectors`). Declarations only: NO personal value is ever in this file (the repo is public; values live in EncryptedSharedPreferences on the device and in the owner's private repos, fetched at run time). libs/account-ui/account-ui.json is the GENERATED byte-equal mirror libs:account-ui bakes into BuildConfig.ACCOUNT_UI_B64 / CONFIGS_SOURCES_B64 (edit THIS file, then `cp` it over the mirror); Cloud Account's build.json::ui personal and configs must match it page for page. ac_cloud-me/test/test-profile-sot.sh fails on any drift. `_doc*` keys are not baked.",
